  "finding": "HaplotypeCaller explicitly documents maximum ploidy across intervals overlapping the active region, so a variant start can lie outside the interval selecting its ploidy. HaplotypeCallerEngine implements this in getPloidyToUseAtThisSite before local genotyping.",
